;~  fields are MPL-2.0 FAIR-bioHeaders contributions (March 2025 onward).
;~voucherSpecimen: 'BioSample SAMN02803731 (uid 2803731), sample name and title "iso-1",
;~  which the record describes as the isogenic strain used for sequencing of the reference
;~  genome by BDGP and Celera Genomics: strain iso-1, tissue whole embryo, dev_stage
;~  embryos, sex mixed. The parent molecule''s GenBank source feature gives the stock
;~  genotype y[1]; Gr22b[1] Gr22d[1] cn[1] CG33964[R4.2] bw[1] sp[1]; LysC[1] MstProx[1]
;~  GstD5[1] Rh6[1], identical to the BioSample genotype attribute. No physical voucher
;~  accession is stated.'
;~documentation: 'Pilot and teaching artifact, not a production reference. Every record
;~  is copied verbatim, defline and sequence lines, from the RefSeq protein FASTA of
;~  GCF_000001215.4 in delivery order; membership was decided by the genomic.gff of
;~  the same delivery, which is the authority for which CDS lie on NC_004353.4: 2743
;~  CDS lines, 298 distinct protein_id values, 298 records here, and the delivery''s
;~  cds_from_genomic FASTA names the same 298 accessions on that molecule. The parent
;~  FHR beside this file is a chromosome 4 subset, so its checksum covers that subset
;~  only; a production protein set taken from this assembly links the whole-assembly
;~  FHR instead. Measured on the shipped bytes: 298 records, 319099 residues, alphabet
;~  ACDEFGHIKLMNPQRSTVWXY with one X (the nonconsensus codon at residue 544 of NP_001368990.1,
;~  which the delivery''s GenBank record marks with a transl_except qualifier as aa
;~  OTHER), no stop characters and no lower case, so a reader that expects a terminal
;~  stop must not assume one. Measured linkage: those 298 CDS sit on 298 transcripts
;~  of 80 distinct gene features, every one of them gene_biotype protein_coding, with
;~  up to 12 annotated transcripts per gene, and no isoform filter was applied, so isoformPolicy
;~  is all for this subset of this delivery. geneticCode is absent deliberately: the
;~  delivery states no translation table for these CDS (the genomic.gff gives codon_start
;~  with no transl_table, the feature table records no attributes for them, and the
;~  GenBank record carries a transl_except without naming a table), and an unstated
;~  table is not an asserted one. accessionID and scholarlyArticle are absent for the
;~  same reason: this protein set has no accession of its own beyond the parent assembly
;~  and molecule, and the GenBank record lists gene-model annotation articles (PubMed
;~  26109357, 26109356) without naming one as the publication of the 6.54 protein set.
;~  predictionSoftware and predictionProtocol are absent because the delivery attributes
;~  these models to FlyBase curation without a pipeline or software version, and completeness
;~  is absent because no BUSCO run was done on this subset. version is the annotation
;~  release the source names (FlyBase Release 6.54); dateCreated is the date this subset
;~  was derived, 2026-11-15, while the delivery carries its own update dates (GenBank
;~  LOCUS 26-DEC-2023, annotation_hashes 2023-12-27). See README.md in this directory
;~  for the probes, digests and commands.'
;~checksum: pOu7KAKSHg5tOw0snOEZ69I7T7Q/BpVpxiyTAp7bPg8=
